• M0: project scaffold + CI
• M1: HTTPS fetch + DOM tree
• M2: hand-written CSS + layout + ASCII render
• M3: boa_engine + JS-to-DOM bridge
• M4: SPA rendering + sync fetch
• M5: GUI window (winit + softbuffer)


